      "short": "Recap",
      "chapter": "recap",
      "title": "Recap",
      "body": [
        "<ul class=\"takeaways\">\n          <li>Every remote call needs a <b>timeout</b> and a <b>fallback</b>.</li>\n          <li><b>Retry</b> transient errors — with <b>exponential backoff, jitter</b> and a cap.</li>\n          <li>A <b>circuit breaker</b> stops hammering a service that is down.</li>\n          <li>Retried operations must be <b>idempotent</b>.</li>\n          <li>Propagate <b>deadlines</b>; isolate dependencies with <b>bulkheads</b>.</li>\n        </ul>"
      ],
